### DSP simulator — bid, debug, reload
#
# Drive the simulator standalone with the real OpenRTB requests captured under
# ./internal/sdkapi/v2/apihandlers/testdata/auction/adikteev/.
#
# Query overrides on /openrtb/bid:
#   ?dsp=<name>       force the DSP bucket (overrides imp.displaymanager)
#   ?adtype=<type>    force banner|interstitial|rewarded (resolves the
#                     fullscreen ambiguity that reward-> instl=1 requests share)
#   ?creative=<id>    pin a creative by id, e.g. default_vast_video

@dspsimHost = http://localhost:1325


### Bid — banner (iOS)
POST {{dspsimHost}}/openrtb/bid
Content-Type: application/json

< ./internal/sdkapi/v2/apihandlers/testdata/auction/adikteev/ios_adikteev_banner_bidreq.json


### Bid — banner / MREC (Android)
POST {{dspsimHost}}/openrtb/bid
Content-Type: application/json

< ./internal/sdkapi/v2/apihandlers/testdata/auction/adikteev/android_adikteev_banner_mrec_bidreq.json


### Bid — interstitial (Android) — pinned to interstitial so the fullscreen ambiguity does not resolve to rewarded
POST {{dspsimHost}}/openrtb/bid?adtype=interstitial
Content-Type: application/json

< ./internal/sdkapi/v2/apihandlers/testdata/auction/adikteev/android_adikteev_interstitial_bidreq.json


### Bid — rewarded (iOS) — force the VAST creative
POST {{dspsimHost}}/openrtb/bid?adtype=rewarded&creative=default_vast_video
Content-Type: application/json

< ./internal/sdkapi/v2/apihandlers/testdata/auction/adikteev/ios_adikteev_rewarded_bidreq.json


### Bid — unknown DSP bucket — falls back to default creatives
POST {{dspsimHost}}/openrtb/bid?dsp=tinkoff
Content-Type: application/json

< ./internal/sdkapi/v2/apihandlers/testdata/auction/adikteev/android_adikteev_banner_bidreq.json


### Debug — catalog snapshot (what the simulator considered a configured auction)
GET {{dspsimHost}}/debug/catalog


### Debug — recorded bids, notifications, and orphan notifications
GET {{dspsimHost}}/debug/bids


### Debug — recorded bids for one DSP
GET {{dspsimHost}}/debug/bids?dsp=adikteev


### Debug — creative library and serve counts
GET {{dspsimHost}}/debug/creatives


### Debug — reload catalog and creative library without a restart
POST {{dspsimHost}}/debug/reload


### Debug — clear the bid registry
DELETE {{dspsimHost}}/debug/bids


### Health
GET {{dspsimHost}}/health_checks
